# Deploy after changes

After completing code changes in this project:

1. `git add` changed files (never `.clasp.json`, secrets, or credentials)
2. `git commit` with a short message focused on why
3. `git push`

Do this without being asked, unless the user explicitly says not to commit or push.

`clasp push` runs automatically in GitHub Actions on push to `main` (see `.github/workflows/clasp-push.yml`); do not run `clasp push` locally.

If there are no changes to commit, skip git steps.
